  solverDict -- the recycle plan.  ONE cut: the MATERIAL recycle (Recycle,
  the separator vapour going back).  The base case's second cut -- the
  converter outlet that preheats its own feed through the FEHE -- does not
  exist at the feasibility stage: the feed is heated by a duty, not by the
  effluent.
